PROSE SUMMARY (context, not a substitute for the structured log above)
---------------------------------------------------------------------
24-turn game. Zutilt10 ran a Primitive Furnace/Single-Shot Rifle self-ping engine, repeatedly sacrificing overcosted threats (Shadowbeak destroyed twice via self-inflicted 1500 damage, turns 14 and 20) to fuel deployments. DeftCHIMP's Leezpunk/Maraith chipped Zutilt10 early (10->9->8->6->5) while several DeftCHIMP interrupts (Reindrix, Foxparks, Cryolinx) bare-form-nullified Zutilt10's attacks (turns 7, 13, 16, 19, 22) and one full-form (turn 8). Zutilt10's Univolt destroyed DeftCHIMP's Shoddy Bed early (turn 5); a mutual Kitsun/Lyleen Noct trade occurred turn 17. Zutilt10's Kitsun (buffed via Pump-Action Shotgun/Single-Shot Rifle) became the primary closer, chipping DeftCHIMP down turn by turn (10->8->6->3->1->0) alongside a Suzaku hit for 3, finishing on turn 24.


